# Web3Forms access key for the project-suggestion form on /projetos.
# Get one at https://web3forms.com by registering projects@agorasimlab.com;
# the key arrives by email. It identifies the inbox, not the sender, so it
# is public by design and safe in client code — set it as a build-time
# environment variable in the Cloudflare Pages project.
# Without it the form renders but reports itself as unconfigured.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
